{"id":"n62675-1-9","stage":1,"title":"서랍 · 抽屉","scene":"居家找衣服","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62675-1-9-1","ko":"엄마 제 빨간색 셔츠는 어디에 있어요?","zh":"妈妈，我的红色衬衫在哪里呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我的","explanation":"제 是 저의 的缩略，表示“我的”；语气谦逊。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"빨간색","meaning":"红色","explanation":"빨간색：红色。","readings":[{"term":"빨간색","audio":"/audio/312153cf826c5582fb77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26849","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨간색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨간색","audio":"/audio/312153cf826c5582fb77.mp3"}},{"text":"셔츠는","meaning":"衬衫","explanation":"셔츠：衬衫；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"셔츠","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64284","senseId":"1","lemma":"셔츠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"셔츠는","audio":"/audio/7f5aafea64bd7baba8e3.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"在哪里","explanation":"있다：某物位于某处；-어요? 是礼貌问句，这里询问衬衫的位置。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"8","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我、我的（제）","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"谦称“我”；与 -의 缩合成 제，表示“我的”。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"312153cf826c5582","term":"빨간색","zh":"红色","audio":"/audio/312153cf826c5582fb77.mp3","entryId":"26849","definition":"像鲜血、熟透的苹果、辣椒般红红的颜色。","pronunciation":["빨간색"]},{"id":"0f9ab32a190bfc01","term":"셔츠","zh":"衬衫","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3","entryId":"64284","definition":"可穿在西装内，也可外穿的西式上衣。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在、位于","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"物体占据某个位置；这里问红衬衫在哪里。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e9573eb55e01443fc59e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62675-1-9-2","ko":"옷장 두 번째 서랍을 열어 보렴.","zh":"去打开衣柜的第二个抽屉看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옷장","meaning":"衣橱，衣柜","explanation":"옷장：衣橱，衣柜。","readings":[{"term":"옷장","audio":"/audio/69d674f79595c850af31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68496","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷장","audio":"/audio/69d674f79595c850af31.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"二","explanation":"두 是数字“二”的冠词形；与后面的 번째 合用，表示“第二个”。","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"번째","meaning":"第二个（与 두 连用）","explanation":"두 번째：第二个；번 标记次序，-째 构成序数表达。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/